Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; PGA TOUR Golf Team Challenge (Global VR, 4.0.0): the cabinet's registry, from the game's install
; CD (its _Registry, copied to the dump): the frontend's settings (Shell.reg: Anark player,
; GVRShell\PGA40, GvrPlus paths), the cabinet's supervisor (HerculesSetup.reg), the game's
; (HKEY_LOCAL_EASPORTS.reg, HKCU_EASPORTS.reg, HKEY_CURRENT_USER_EA.reg, HKEY_LOCAL_EACom.reg,
; HKEY_LOCAL_ElArts.reg), its courses (one file each) and fonts (HKLM Fonts.reg). Imported at
; each launch. The data engine's schema path (the GvrPlus installer's, PGA.msi).

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\gvr\Plus\1.1\Cabinet]
"PlusSchemaPath"="C:\\GvrPlus\\4\\schema\\pgacabinetXml.enc"

